OL,4,CFootball club granted permission to    
OL,5,Ccreate fan zone                        
OL,6,GA non-league football club has been    
OL,7,Ggranted planning permission for a new  
OL,8,Gfan zone at its ground.                
OL,10,FHarborough Town asked for permission   
OL,11,Fto improve its facilities following    
OL,12,Fits promotion to the National League   
OL,13,FNorth.                                 
OL,15,FThe plans, which were approved by      
OL,16,FHarborough District Council on Monday  
OL,17,F23 November, will include food and     
OL,18,Fdrink serving areas, a club shop, a    
OL,19,Fstage for entertainment and television 
OL,20,Fscreens.                               
OL,22,                                   G1/4 
