OL,4,CMurder victim's mum backs plan to      
OL,5,Ctackle knife crime                     
OL,6,GA mum whose son was stabbed to death   
OL,7,Gsaid fresh funding to tackle knife     
OL,8,Gcrime in Nottinghamshire should be     
OL,9,Ginvested in early prevention.          
OL,11,FNottinghamshire Police has been        
OL,12,Fawarded #450,000 to tackle the problem 
OL,13,Fin eight areas: the Broadmarsh, Old    
OL,14,FMarket Square and Victoria Centre in   
OL,15,FNottingham city centre, Hucknall,      
OL,16,FBeeston, Mansfield town centre, the    
OL,17,FRavensdale area of Mansfield and       
OL,18,FSutton-in-Ashfield.                    
OL,22,                                   G3/4 
