OL,4,CResidents fear loss of green space in  
OL,5,Chousing plan                           
OL,6,GCampaigners say they fear a "much-     
OL,7,Gloved green space" will be destroyed   
OL,8,Gif the creation of an access road to a 
OL,9,Gnew housing development is approved.   
OL,11,FResidents living in West Hunsbury,     
OL,12,FNorthampton, say they support the      
OL,13,Fbuilding of new homes but oppose plans 
OL,14,Fto build an access road through the    
OL,15,Fland.                                  
OL,17,FDeveloper Bellway Homes has submitted  
OL,18,Fa planning application to West         
OL,19,FNorthamptonshire Council to build 92   
OL,20,Fproperties, using the green space to   
OL,21,Fprovide access to the site.            
OL,22,                                   G4/4 
